=== batch-1 vs batch-4 bit-identity (0.8B, --max-tokens 2048) ===
--- $ python3 ref/perplexity_eval.py --corpus ref/ppl_corpus_eval.txt --max-tokens 2048 --batch 1 --quiet
nll_sum 5225.176101  positions 2044  nll/pos 2.556348  eval 15.1s (build 7.5s)
PPL 12.888667
--- $ python3 ref/perplexity_eval.py --corpus ref/ppl_corpus_eval.txt --max-tokens 2048 --batch 4 --quiet
nll_sum 5225.176101  positions 2044  nll/pos 2.556348  eval 7.2s (build 7.5s)
PPL 12.888667
=== identical nll_sum and PPL above == batch is a pure speed knob ===
